Homepage: https://github.com/fabianoflorentino/vidctl
Installed-Size: 20000
Depends: libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.24), libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, ffmpeg
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Description: Compress video to the exact size of each platform
 vidctl calculates the bitrate to fit a target size using ffmpeg two-pass
 encoding, keeping duration and format intact. Desktop app built with Wails
 and Go, 100% offline.
